OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney defends #45,000
OL,4,Abusiness-class flights to World Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney insisted the government had
OL,7,Fsought to "minimise" costs, while
OL,8,FJustice Secretary Neil Gray defended
OL,9,Fthe business class flights as a means
OL,10,Fof ensuring ministers "arrive fresh"
OL,11,Fwhen they travel overseas.
